%% Corpus gates and generated build: human decisions are never automated
sequenceDiagram
  actor Maintainer
  actor Reviewer
  participant Ingest as ingest.py / segment.py
  participant State as .state.json
  participant Scheme as scheme.md
  participant CI as validate.py / build.py --check
  Maintainer->>Ingest: Ingest committed official PDF
  Ingest->>State: Ask Gates 0–3 interactively
  Reviewer->>Ingest: Inspect source, extraction and segments
  Ingest-->>Maintainer: Chunks for drafting
  Maintainer->>Scheme: Draft quotes, clauses and expressions
  Reviewer->>Ingest: Run review.py (Gate 4)
  Ingest->>State: Save named clause decisions
  Reviewer->>Ingest: Run review.py --conditions (Gate 5)
  Ingest->>State: Save named boundary decisions
  CI->>Scheme: Validate quotes and grammar
  CI->>Scheme: Check generated projections are fresh
  CI-->>Maintainer: Pass or reviewable failure
